#: lib/editor.inc.php:887
msgid "Where should Weathermap get data for this link? This can either be an RRD file, or an HTML with special comments in it (normally from MRTG)."
msgstr "Weathermap 應從哪裡獲取此鏈接的數據？這可以是 RRD 檔，也可以是其中包含特殊註釋的 HTML（通常來自 MRTG）。"

