msgid "If you are using the 'overlib' HTML style then this is the URL that will be opened when you click on the link"
msgstr "如果您使用的是“overlib”HTML 樣式，那麼這是當您按兩下連結時將打開的URL"

#: lib/editor.inc.php:890
