#: lib/editor.inc.php:896
msgid "If you are using the 'overlib' HTML style then this is the URL of the image that will be shown when you hover over the node"
msgstr "如果您使用的是“overlib”HTML 樣式，那麼當您將滑鼠懸停在節點上時，這是將顯示的圖像的 URL"

